%% @title Checkout — request sequence
%% @summary Calls between the checkout screen, its hook, the API client and the backend when an order is placed.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Customer
  participant CHK as Checkout screen
  participant HK as useCheckoutHandlers
  participant API as API client
  participant BE as Ordering backend
  U->>CHK: Tap Place order
  CHK->>HK: onPlaceOrder()
  HK->>API: POST /orders
  API->>BE: HTTPS request
  alt payment approved
    BE-->>API: 201 Created
    API-->>HK: order
    HK-->>CHK: navigate to confirmation
  else payment declined
    BE-->>API: 402 Payment Required
    API-->>HK: error
    HK-->>CHK: show error banner
  end
